{"kind":"assert","text":"Addition to the scope of NF-5 (c288c917), from ruling on 17ba8c9e.\n\nNF-3 leaves named exports of the client's custody names in the MCP\nindex and the MCP Node entry. NF-5 moves every remaining importer to\n`@generalbusiness/dap-client` or `@generalbusiness/dap-client/node`\nand deletes those exports. After NF-5 the MCP package exports only\nwhat it owns. The list of names is on the notes page of NF-3.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}